    {
      "page_idx": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.029,
            0.117,
            0.512,
            0.137
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二. 是非题（每题1分，共30分），答案请标明每题的序号。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.024,
            0.159,
            0.749,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.16,
                0.567,
                0.18
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\mathrm{N}^{5}-\\mathrm{CH}_{3}-\\mathrm{FH}_{4}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 携带有甲基，为机体内大多数甲基化反应提供甲基。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.187,
                0.585,
                0.206
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. DNA polymerase 和 RNA polymerase 都有校读（proofreading）活性。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.209,
                0.506,
                0.227
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 转氨酶可催化谷氨酰胺发生转氨基作用生成 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "-酮戊二酸。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.231,
                0.749,
                0.271
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 在蛋白质生物合成过程中识别起始 AUG （initiation codon AUG）和开放读框中的 AUG（internal codon AUG）的 tRNA 不一样。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.276,
                0.417,
                0.294
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 胰岛素的A链和B链是由同一个基因编码的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.298,
                0.543,
                0.316
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. DNA 复制和转录过程中，新链的合成方向都是从 5`到 3`方向。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.321,
                0.462,
                0.339
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 多肽固相化学合成和生物合成的延伸方向是一致的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.343,
                0.378,
                0.361
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 甲硫氨酸(Methionine)是人体必需氨基酸。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.365,
                0.497,
                0.383
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 机体尿素合成障碍是导致尿酸水平增加的主要原因之一。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.388,
                0.655,
                0.406
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10. 糖代谢中磷酸戊糖途径产生的脱氧核糖主要用于脱氧核糖核苷酸的生物合成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.41,
                0.377,
                0.428
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "11. 天然单糖为D构型，因此其旋光性向右。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.432,
                0.442,
                0.45
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "12. 朊病毒是一种易于被诱导发生构型变化的蛋白质。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.455,
                0.577,
                0.473
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "13. 细胞内的DNA出现三链或四链结构，说明该细胞处于不正常状态。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.477,
                0.55,
                0.495
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "14. SDS-PAGE时，不同大小蛋白质分子的电荷/质量比值趋于相同。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.499,
                0.547,
                0.518
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15. 酶可以降低生化反应的活化能，因此可以改变反应的平衡常数。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.522,
                0.406,
                0.54
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "16. 肌红蛋白与氧分子的结合都具有正协同效应。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.544,
                0.352,
                0.562
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "17. 膜脂中不饱和脂肪酸主要是顺式构型。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.567,
                0.48,
                0.585
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "18. 蛋白质具有高级结构，而DNA和RNA没有高级结构。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.589,
                0.459,
                0.607
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "19. "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "-D-吡喃葡萄糖与 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "-D-吡喃葡萄糖不是对映异构体。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.611,
                0.356,
                0.629
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "20. G蛋白和小G蛋白是细胞膜结合蛋白。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.634,
                0.58,
                0.653
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "21. 生物固氮作用通常需要厌氧环境主要是因为钼铁蛋白对氧非常敏感。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 23,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.656,
                0.422,
                0.674
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "22. 半胱氨酸和甲硫氨酸是体内硫酸根的主要供体。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.678,
                0.512,
                0.697
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "23. 蛋白质的寿命通常与其成熟蛋白质的C端氨基酸序列有关。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.7,
                0.369,
                0.718
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "24. 氨甲酰磷酸在体内可以合成尿素和嘌呤。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 26,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.722,
                0.28,
                0.74
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "25. 氨在水中的溶解度小于尿酸。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 27,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.745,
                0.468,
                0.763
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "26. 某些DNA序列既可以作为增强子又可以作为沉默子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 28,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.768,
                0.314,
                0.786
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "27. ppGpp 在细菌缺乏氮源时被合成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 29,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.79,
                0.526,
                0.808
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "28. 天冬氨酸是由柠檬酸循环中的中间物质经转氨作用而形成的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 30,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.812,
                0.737,
                0.832
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "29. 在高乳糖，低葡萄糖的情况下，乳糖操纵子的转录活性比高乳糖，高葡萄糖的情况更高。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 31,
              "bbox": [
                0.029,
                0.835,
                0.312,
                0.853
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "30. 一氧化氮受体是可溶性 GC 受体。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.02,
            0.872,
            0.509,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三.问答题（每题10分，共90分），答案请标明每题的序号。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 33,
          "bbox": [
            0.02,
            0.906,
            0.605,
            0.925
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 简述胶原蛋白和丝蛋白在结构和氨基酸组成上的特点及其与功能的适应。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
